  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coastal Protection at Gn. Fuvahmulah</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to protect the southern islands of Fuvahmulah Maradhoo and Feydhoo against flooding due to rising sea-level and the ongoing coast erosion in order to protect the population of these islands. The combination of beach replenishment with revetments will protect the shorelines of the southern islands of Maldives against erosion and subsequent flooding in a sustainable effective and cost-efficient way.</narrative>
  </description>
